 * Programmatic SEO for the `(location) (service)` pattern, e.g. "London VPS
 * Hosting", "Toronto Web Hosting", "Frankfurt Game Server Hosting". The route
 * (`app/(marketing)/[slug]/page.tsx`) is driven entirely by this data table:
 * every page's H1, title, meta, OG, prose, why-points, steps, FAQ and internal
 * links are generated here from a (location × service) pair, so each page is
